ちょ… 待って…
Wait... hold on...

213
00:24:03,579 --> 00:24:07,079
ハッピーバースデー プレゼント！
Happy birthday present!

214
00:24:07,579 --> 00:24:11,879
あああ～！ そんな～！
Ahhh! No way~!

215
00:24:12,579 --> 00:24:15,579
大丈夫！？ こぼのギター！
Are you okay!? Kobo's guitar!

216
00:24:15,579 --> 00:24:18,879
セシぃどこ？
Where's Ceci?

217
00:24:19,079 --> 00:24:22,879
助けてー ギターが！
Help! The guitar!

218
00:24:22,879 --> 00:24:25,579
あ！ セシィ！
Ah! Ceci!

219
00:24:25,579 --> 00:24:29,079
大丈夫？ 重っ…
Are you okay? It's heavy...

220
00:24:29,079 --> 00:24:32,079
ああ 良かった
Ah, thank goodness.

221
00:24:32,279 --> 00:24:35,579
ギター 避難させといたよ！
I evacuated the guitar!

222
00:24:35,579 --> 00:24:38,879
どうも… セシリアが 無事でよかった
Thanks... I'm glad Cecilia is safe.

223
00:24:39,079 --> 00:24:41,879
ありがとう！
Thank you!

224
00:24:42,079 --> 00:24:44,579
誕生日おめでとう！
Happy Birthday!

225
00:24:44,579 --> 00:24:47,579
ありがとう！
Thank you!

226
00:24:47,579 --> 00:24:49,579
手に持ってるの 何？
What's that in your hands?

227
00:24:49,579 --> 00:24:51,879
何にも？
Nothing?

228
00:24:52,879 --> 00:24:54,879
それ… 私の？
Are those... mine?

229
00:24:54,879 --> 00:24:57,079
しゃ～？ 私のマラカス！
Well...? My maracas!

230
00:24:57,079 --> 00:25:00,079
イナ それ私の物でしょ！
Ina, those are mine!

231
00:25:00,079 --> 00:25:03,079
はいはい あはる勝ち！
Alright, alright, here you go!

232
00:25:03,079 --> 00:25:05,079
ありがとう！
Thank you!

233
00:25:09,044 --> 00:25:12,594
みんなは この後もー いてくれるの？
So you guys are staying for the rest... You guys are staying?

234
00:25:12,994 --> 00:25:16,794
いや そろそろ行かなきゃ… 行きましょう！
No, we... we're just gonna... Let's go!

235
00:25:16,894 --> 00:25:20,894
バイバイ！ 誕生日おめでとう！
Bye-bye! Happy birthday!

236
00:25:20,994 --> 00:25:23,094
ありがとう ございます
Thank you so much!

237
00:25:23,194 --> 00:25:25,594
みんな どうやって ここを出るの？
How... how are you guys getting out of here?

238
00:25:25,694 --> 00:25:27,594
さあ？
I don't know.

239
00:25:29,794 --> 00:25:31,594
え…？
What the...?

240
00:25:31,694 --> 00:25:33,994
どうなってんだよ！
This sucks!

241
00:25:34,094 --> 00:25:35,294
えっと…
Wait, actually...

242
00:25:36,594 --> 00:25:41,594
イマーレッド 聞こえるか！ ここから出せ！ ここから 出せェエエ！！
Imma Red, can you hear me? Let me out! Let me out!

243
00:25:42,594 --> 00:25:48,594
なんで こんな場所に… 誕生日に 歌って 踊るはずだったのに…
Why am I here right now...? It's my birthday and I'm supposed to sing and dance...

244
00:25:49,094 --> 00:25:51,894
もし ここが アイドルステージだったら…
I wish I was on an idol stage...

245
00:26:04,094 --> 00:26:15,094
顔面 笑みだ 確定 不確定 簡単 勝ちだ そこが 隙だ
Smirk on your face, definite, indefinite, easy win, that's the crack.

246
00:26:26,094 --> 00:26:30,894
ニヤついて ニヤついて ヒヤリっと後でしたらいい
Smirk and smirk, you can shudder later.

247
00:26:31,094 --> 00:26:36,094
ニヤついて ニヤついて ヒアリにでも食われとけってんの
Smirk and smirk, let the fire ants eat you, I say.

248
00:26:36,894 --> 00:26:41,094
ニヤついて ニヤついて ヒヤリっと後でしたらいい
Smirk and smirk, you can shudder later.

249
00:26:41,594 --> 00:26:46,894
ニヤついて ニヤついて ヒアリにでも食われとけってんの
Smirk and smirk, let the fire ants eat you, I say.

250
00:26:47,094 --> 00:26:58,094
顔面 笑みだ 確定 不確定 簡単 勝ちだ そこが 隙だ
Smirk on your face, definite, indefinite, easy win, that's the crack.

251
00:26:58,594 --> 00:27:09,094
顔面 笑みだ 確定 不確定 簡単 勝ちだ そこが 隙だ
Smirk on your face, definite, indefinite, easy win, that's the crack.

252
00:27:19,094 --> 00:27:24,094
お互いの駆け引きで また最初から また最初から
Bargaining with each other, starting from scratch again, starting from scratch again.

253
00:27:24,594 --> 00:27:29,594
引っ返したりはなしよ またあいこなら またあいこなら
No turning back now, if we're even again, if we're even again.

254
00:27:29,894 --> 00:27:34,894
一回きりはごめん 足りないから 足りないから
Once is not enough, sorry, because it's not enough, because it's not enough.

255
00:27:35,094 --> 00:27:42,894
何回してもまたよ 隙を知らない 隙を知らないからね そのままでいてね
No matter how many times, we'll do it again, because you know no bounds, because you know no bounds, stay as you are.

256
00:27:43,094 --> 00:27:53,894
顔面 笑みだ 確定 不確定 簡単 勝ちだ そこが 隙だ
Smirk on your face, definite, indefinite, easy win, that's the crack.

257
00:27:54,094 --> 00:28:05,094
顔面 笑みだ 確定 不確定 簡単 勝ちだ そこが 隙だ
Smirk on your face, definite, indefinite, easy win, that's the crack.

258
00:28:07,894 --> 00:28:11,594
ありがとう！ バイバイ！
Thank you for joining! Bye-bye!

259
00:28:12,594 --> 00:28:15,594
待て ジジ！ 待て！
Wait, Gigi, wait! Wait!

260
00:28:15,894 --> 00:28:19,594
こっち 来なさい！ 私と約束したでしょ！
Come back here! You promised me!

261
00:28:20,594 --> 00:28:23,894
予定に入れていたのを 忘れていました
Oh yes, I forgot that I scheduled that into my calendar.

262
00:28:24,094 --> 00:28:25,594
お座りください
Why don't you sit down?

263
00:28:25,694 --> 00:28:27,094
何 その喋り方…
Why are you talking like that...?

264
00:28:27,194 --> 00:28:30,594
やっとセラピーを 受けられる！
Finally, I get my promised therapy session!

265
00:28:31,594 --> 00:28:34,894
リラックスできてますか セシリアさん？
Are you comfortable, Cecilia Immergreen?

266
00:28:35,094 --> 00:28:36,894
たぶん…
Yeah, I guess so...

267
00:28:37,094 --> 00:28:40,094
お隣に失礼します 全ての始まりは あの時…
Let me sit down next to you. So it all started when...

268
00:28:40,594 --> 00:28:42,094
今の気分は？
How do you feel right now?

269
00:28:42,294 --> 00:28:47,894
楽しく踊って いい気分だけど― イマーレッドが生誕ライブを 邪魔してきて イラつく！
I mean, I'm okay, I had fun dancing, but I'm frustrated because Imma Red is ruining my birthday live!

270
00:28:48,094 --> 00:28:49,894
それは お気の毒に
Oh no, I'm sorry you feel that way.

271
00:28:50,094 --> 00:28:52,894
なぜイマーレッドさんは 邪魔してくるのでしょう？
Why do you feel that Imma Red is ruining your birthday live?

272
00:28:53,094 --> 00:28:55,894
アイツのことは よく知らんし…
I don't know, I don't even really know her, to be honest...

273
00:28:56,094 --> 00:28:58,094
ほう なぜです？
Oh, why not?

274
00:28:58,294 --> 00:29:01,594
だって もう2年ぐらい 会ってないし！
Because I haven't seen her in like two years!

275
00:29:02,094 --> 00:29:04,894
その2年間 彼女はどうしてました？
Well, what has she been doing in these two years?

276
00:29:05,094 --> 00:29:10,594
私があいつを ピンに閉じ込めて― 棚に置きっぱなしに…？ 暖房器具の隣に？
I think she was like in a jar or something... I trapped her and put her on my shelf... next to a radiator?

277
00:29:11,094 --> 00:29:13,594
出してあげては？
Let's unpack that.

278
00:29:13,894 --> 00:29:20,594
でも邪魔される筋合いは ありません ピンに詰められたからって 誕生日を台無しにするなんて…
Well, I feel like it's really unfair that she's doing this. Just because she was in there doesn't really matter, and she shouldn't ruin my birthday.

279
00:29:21,094 --> 00:29:25,094
確定申告をする場合…
I see. Well, if you would like to file taxes...

280
00:29:25,594 --> 00:29:32,594
イマーレッドは 別人扱いになるので 課される税金は 2倍ということに… は？ 何の話？
...Imma Red would count as another person, so you might have to file double taxes... What? What are you talking about?

281
00:29:35,094 --> 00:29:36,594
失礼しました
Oh, I'm sorry.

282
00:29:36,894 --> 00:29:41,594
その喋り方は何？ 本当にジジ？ セラピー中に 税金の話を するつもりは ありませんでした
Why are you talking like this? Are you even Gigi? I did not mean to talk about taxes during your therapy session.

283
00:29:41,894 --> 00:29:50,094
話を逸らしてばかり！ 誤解させたなら すみません 苛立つ気持ちは分かります そうするように プログラムされています 何を言ってるの！？ こんなの時間無駄！
You're just derailing the conversation! I did not mean to derail you. I understand your frustrations. It is in my code... What? What are you talking about? You're wasting my time!

284
00:29:52,094 --> 00:29:53,594
なぜ そう感じるのですか？
Why do you feel that way?

285
00:29:53,694 --> 00:29:55,594
アンタが 脱線ばかりするからだよ！
Because you are derailing our conversation!

286
00:29:55,694 --> 00:29:57,894
すみません 脱線させるつもりは…
I'm so sorry, I did not mean to derail our conversation.

287
00:29:58,094 --> 00:30:04,894
お前 ジジじゃないな！ お前は 偽物のジジだ！ 本物のジジがやりそうなこと やってみなさい！
You're not the real Gigi Murin! You're a fake Gigi! Do something only the real Gigi would do!

288
00:30:05,109 --> 00:30:06,186
分かりました
Got it.

289
00:30:06,186 --> 00:30:09,257
本物のジジ・ムリンがやりそうなことをします
I will do something only the real Gigi Murin would do.

290
00:30:09,257 --> 00:30:10,735
なんで近づいてくるの？
Why are you coming closer?

291
00:30:10,735 --> 00:30:13,899
何してんの？
What are you doing?

292
00:30:13,899 --> 00:30:15,620
何を…
What are you...

293
00:30:15,620 --> 00:30:18,735
うわああああ！！
Aaaah!

294
00:30:18,735 --> 00:30:20,765
お前はジジじゃない！
You're not even the real Gigi!

295
00:30:20,765 --> 00:30:23,176
誰だお前！？
Who are you?!

296
00:30:23,176 --> 00:30:25,279
2026年分の確定申告をする場合は…
When filing your 2026 tax return...

297
00:30:25,279 --> 00:30:26,520
偽物め！
You impostor!

298
00:30:26,520 --> 00:30:30,241
セシリア！ やめろ ジジだよ！！
Cecilia! Stop! It's me, Gigi!

299
00:30:30,241 --> 00:30:33,276
命だけは！！
Spare my life!!

300
00:30:33,276 --> 00:30:36,536
おい 何をやってるんだ！？ 戻れ！
Hey, what are you doing there? Get back!

301
00:30:36,536 --> 00:30:38,509
うわあああああ
Aaaah!

302
00:30:40,417 --> 00:30:45,066
また ここに戻ってきた！？ イマーレッドめ！
I'm back here again?! Imma Red!

303
00:30:45,066 --> 00:30:48,875
最初は可愛くて いい子だと思ってたのに…
At first I thought you were kind of fun and cute...

304
00:30:48,875 --> 00:30:51,854
ドジなところも 可愛らしかったのに…
It was endearing to see you fail, but...

305
00:30:51,854 --> 00:30:54,767
また ここに戻しやがって あの野郎！
You keep bringing me back! I hate you, you suck!

306
00:30:54,767 --> 00:30:58,758
でも夜になってる…
But it's nighttime now... It's really pretty.

307
00:30:58,758 --> 00:31:01,357
水面も綺麗！ 気づかなかったな
Look at the water, I didn't notice this before.

308
00:31:01,357 --> 00:31:04,991
映ってて 綺麗…
The reflection is so pretty...

309
00:31:04,991 --> 00:31:06,999
水の物理演算だ！
Water physics!

310
00:31:06,999 --> 00:31:09,715
でも 正直言って 我慢の限界
Okay, well... Honestly, I've had enough.

311
00:31:09,715 --> 00:31:13,423
秘密兵器を使おう！
I'm going to use my secret weapon!

312
00:31:13,423 --> 00:31:15,949
これだ！
This!

313
00:31:15,949 --> 00:31:19,030
皆様 これは何かお思いでしょう
You might be asking yourself, what could this be?

314
00:31:19,030 --> 00:31:22,890
ブランコだよ これで物理的に脱出する！
It's a swing! And we're going to use physics to get out of here!

315
00:31:22,890 --> 00:31:31,658
魔法や時間操作でも ダメだったし
Because originally, I mean, I tried magic, I tried time magic, I tried everything...

316
00:31:31,658 --> 00:31:34,918
こうなったら 物理の力だよ
So, I guess good old physics it is.

317
00:31:34,918 --> 00:31:38,908
見て！ 上に 風船が付いてるでしょ？
And for this one, as you can see, there are balloons on top.

318
00:31:38,908 --> 00:31:43,944
飛ぶには もっと風船が必要なの だから みんなの力を貸して！
And if you want to help me get out of here in order to make more balloons so that we can fly...

319
00:31:43,944 --> 00:31:48,893
風船の絵文字を チャットに打ち込みまくって！ 今すぐ！
Please spam the balloon emoji in chat right now! Yes, right now!

320
00:31:48,893 --> 00:31:58,417
スーパーチャットにすると 風船が もっとカラフルになるよ どうするかは みんなに任せるけど 風船の絵文字くだけは お願い！
And what you can also do if you want to is use Super Chats, because then they're going to be colorful balloons. So please do whatever you want, but definitely spam the balloons!

321
00:31:59,909 --> 00:32:02,509
風船がもっと必要！
We need more balloons!

322
00:32:02,509 --> 00:32:04,909
誰か風船を持ってない？
Does anyone have balloons?

323
00:32:04,909 --> 00:32:07,276
急いで急いで！
Hurry, hurry!

324
00:32:07,276 --> 00:32:12,704
風船！ 風船！
Balloons! Balloons!

325
00:32:12,704 --> 00:32:16,248
どれどれ…
I'm watching you...

326
00:32:16,248 --> 00:32:19,452
あっ！ 風船来てる！
Okay, I see some, I see some!

327
00:32:19,452 --> 00:32:22,001
来てるよ！
I see some!

328
00:32:22,001 --> 00:32:24,075
わー！ 可愛い！
Ooh, cute!

329
00:32:24,075 --> 00:32:27,171
オトモ風船可愛い！ 飛ぶにはもっと増やさなきゃ！
Look at the cute little Otomo balloons! Okay, I think we're going to need more.

330
00:32:27,171 --> 00:32:29,603
もっと もっと！
More balloons! More balloons!

331
00:32:29,603 --> 00:32:32,809
もっと風船を！
More balloons!

332
00:32:32,809 --> 00:32:36,042
完璧だよ！これくらいで十分かな？
Perfect! Do you think this is enough?

333
00:32:36,042 --> 00:32:38,309
物理の単位落としたから 分かんないや
I don't know, I failed physics.

334
00:32:38,309 --> 00:32:41,994
もう少し欲しいかな…
I think we need a little bit more...

335
00:32:41,994 --> 00:32:45,963
もっと！
More!

336
00:32:45,963 --> 00:32:48,191
みんな ありがとう
Thank you very much.

337
00:32:48,191 --> 00:32:53,439
待ってろよイマーレッドのバカ！ 脱出だ！
Wait for it, Imma Red, you suck. Let's get out of here!

338
00:32:53,439 --> 00:32:57,105
高所恐怖症じゃなくて よかった
Good thing I don't have a fear of heights.

339
00:32:57,105 --> 00:33:03,321
行くぞ～！
Let's go!

340
00:33:03,321 --> 00:33:05,781
飛んだ！
It actually works!

341
00:33:05,781 --> 00:33:09,062
本当に飛ぶとは 思わなかった…
I didn't think this was gonna work...

342
00:33:09,062 --> 00:33:13,680
すごい！ 高い高い！ めちゃくちゃ飛んでる！
Oh this is awesome! Oh my god, we're so high up!

343
00:33:13,680 --> 00:33:17,829
上手くいきそう！
I think this is going to go great!

344
00:33:17,829 --> 00:33:22,001
ある程度の高さまで飛べば 脱出できるよね？
If I just keep flying at some point I'm going to have to get out of here, right?

345
00:33:22,001 --> 00:33:25,839
これは イマーレッドも予想外のはず
Imma Red can't keep stopping me, right?

346
00:33:25,839 --> 00:33:29,569
空を飛ぶとは思うまい
How would she stop me if I just fly away?

347
00:33:29,569 --> 00:33:32,809
待って どうやって下降するの…？
Wait, how am I gonna get back down...?

348
00:33:59,109 --> 00:34:10,109
[Title: Fate/Apocrypha]

349
00:33:59,109 --> 00:34:10,109
[Text: Music: 横山克]
[Text: Music: Masaru Yokoyama]

350
00:38:06,824 --> 00:38:07,924
愚か者！
You fool!

351
00:38:09,024 --> 00:38:10,924
ただで済むと思うな！
Don't think you can get away with this!

352
00:38:22,624 --> 00:38:25,624
Uh... Where... what is this place?

353
00:38:26,624 --> 00:38:28,124
Immergoldbot?

354
00:38:28,624 --> 00:38:31,124
What are... what are you doing here?

355
00:38:31,724 --> 00:38:34,124
Anyways, uh... let's get out of here!

356
00:38:34,624 --> 00:38:39,924
What if... we use what Ina gave me? You know, the maracas, my maracas, to get out of here!

357
00:38:40,424 --> 00:38:45,624
I mean, that makes a lot of sense, right? Otherwise, why would she have given that to me, plot-wise?

358
00:38:47,624 --> 00:38:52,124
Um, Ms. Immergreen, don't forget... The budget...

359
00:38:54,624 --> 00:38:57,124
Okay... Yeah, don't worry about it.

360
00:38:57,624 --> 00:38:59,724
Crazy that you have reception down here...

361
00:38:59,924 --> 00:39:01,324
Watch this!

362
00:39:06,124 --> 00:39:08,624
No, it's working!

363
00:39:20,624 --> 00:39:24,324
Ugh... Oh god, oh my god, oh my knees...

364
00:39:24,624 --> 00:39:25,924
Yeah, I'm fine.

365
00:39:26,124 --> 00:39:28,624
Wait... isn't... isn't this my 3D debut stage?

366
00:39:28,924 --> 00:39:30,524
What am I doing here?

367
00:39:31,624 --> 00:39:35,924
Hahaha! You thought you could get away? But this is even better!

368
00:39:36,124 --> 00:39:40,124
Wow, you're even bigger now. That's kind of hot...

369
00:39:40,324 --> 00:39:42,124
Huh? What?

370
00:39:42,624 --> 00:39:43,924
Hey, stop! I-

371
00:39:44,024 --> 00:39:46,924
I mean, look at you! You're so-

372
00:39:47,124 --> 00:39:51,124
Shut- Shut up! Shut- Take this!

373
00:39:51,924 --> 00:39:53,924
This is also my stage!

374
00:39:54,124 --> 00:39:57,124
You can't just keep stealing all my stuff just because you're hot now!

375
00:39:57,124 --> 00:40:01,124
Shut up, shut up, shut up, shut up! It's over for you now!

376
00:40:01,924 --> 00:40:04,624
Woah, Aaaaah!

377
00:40:12,679 --> 00:40:14,579
Oh my God, what is this...

378
00:40:14,579 --> 00:40:19,179
Why is this stream... I mean, this birthday, so... hurtful...

379
00:40:19,679 --> 00:40:21,479
It's okay... It's okay.

380
00:40:21,479 --> 00:40:24,079
I have a... I have a plan... I have a plan B.

381
00:40:24,079 --> 00:40:26,479
I'm taking you down!

382
00:40:26,479 --> 00:40:28,679
...Why?

383
00:40:35,479 --> 00:40:41,379
Il giudizio finale sta per essere emesso
The final judgment is about to be passed

384
00:40:41,379 --> 00:40:48,379
Nessuno puo emendarsi dal peccato che scorre nelle vene
No one can cleanse themselves of the sin flowing in their veins

385
00:40:48,379 --> 00:40:54,779
海鳴りの調べに 黒雲は空へ集う
To the melody of the roaring sea, black clouds gather in the sky

386
00:40:54,779 --> 00:41:00,879
嵐を呼ぶ風は 高らかに
The wind calling the storm blows loudly...

387
00:41:00,879 --> 00:41:07,879
謎めく言ノ葉に 魔女達は含み笑う
At the mysterious words, the witches chuckle softly

388
00:41:07,879 --> 00:41:14,679
歪な夜の宴は 繰り返す
The party of a distorted night repeats itself

389
00:41:14,679 --> 00:41:18,179
奈落へと堕ちた
Falling into the abyss...

390
00:41:18,179 --> 00:41:21,679
金色の蝶は
The golden butterfly...

391
00:41:21,679 --> 00:41:24,779
幾つの罪に
Upon how many sins...

392
00:41:24,779 --> 00:41:30,179
翅を濡らしてゆくの？
Will it wet its wings?

393
00:41:30,179 --> 00:41:38,679
なかないで 囚われた幻想を壊し
Don't cry... Destroy the trapped illusion

394
00:41:38,679 --> 00:41:44,179
一度きりの終焉をあげよう
Let us grant a one-time-only demise

395
00:41:44,179 --> 00:41:52,679
果たせない約束は 胸の奥 焦げ付いて
Unfulfilled promises burn deep within the chest

396
00:41:52,679 --> 00:41:58,679
赤く赤く爆ぜてくよ
Bursting into flames, red and intense...

397
00:41:58,679 --> 00:42:03,679
ねぇ
Hey...

398
00:42:03,679 --> 00:42:06,679
Si... Ci sei...
Yes... You are...

399
00:42:06,679 --> 00:42:17,679
Ti accorgi delle voci senza voce?
Do you notice the voiceless voices?

400
00:42:17,679 --> 00:42:24,679
Ti accorgi dei tuoi peccati?
Are you aware of your sins?

401
00:42:24,679 --> 00:42:31,179
癒えない疵口は 紅の薔薇のように
Unhealing wounds are like crimson roses

402
00:42:31,179 --> 00:42:37,679
憎しみ宿る心に 花開く
Blooming in a heart harboring hatred

403
00:42:37,679 --> 00:42:42,179
翼奪われた
Its wings stolen...

404
00:42:42,179 --> 00:42:45,179
片羽の鳥は
The one-winged bird...

405
00:42:45,179 --> 00:42:48,279
最期の瞬間に
In its final moment...

406
00:42:48,279 --> 00:42:53,179
誰の名前を呼ぶの？
Whose name does it call out?

407
00:42:53,179 --> 00:43:00,479
にげないで 過ちも真実も嘘も
Don't run away... Mistakes, truths, and lies

408
00:43:00,479 --> 00:43:06,479
全て赦す魔法へと変えよう
Let us turn them into magic that forgives everything

409
00:43:06,479 --> 00:43:14,679
遅すぎた答えさえ 愛しくて 哀しくて
Even an answer that came too late is beloved and sorrowful

410
00:43:14,679 --> 00:43:29,679
強く強く抱きしめれば ほら
If held tightly, so tightly... look

411
00:43:35,179 --> 00:43:40,179
眩い光溢れ
Overflowing with dazzling light...

412
00:43:40,179 --> 00:43:46,479
楽園の扉は開かれる
The doors of paradise are opened

413
00:43:46,479 --> 00:43:53,179
頑なな運命に 奇跡が降り注ぎ
Onto a stubborn fate, miracles shower down

414
00:43:53,179 --> 00:44:00,179
絡み合う世界は 崩れ落ちてゆく
The intertwined world crumbles away

415
00:44:00,179 --> 00:44:06,679
いわないで 永遠の呪縛の言葉を
Do not say the words of the eternal curse

416
00:44:06,679 --> 00:44:14,679
きかないで 本当の願いを
Do not ask for the true wish

417
00:44:14,679 --> 00:44:27,479
なかないで 囚われた幻想を壊し 一度きりの終焉をあげよう
Don't cry... Destroy the trapped illusion and let us grant a one-time-only demise

418
00:44:27,479 --> 00:44:36,179
果たせない約束は 胸の奥 焦げ付いて 赤く赤く爆ぜてくよ
Unfulfilled promises burn deep within the chest, bursting into flames, red and intense...

419
00:44:36,179 --> 00:44:43,679
ねぇ Impossibile arrivare
Hey... Impossible to reach

420
00:44:43,679 --> 00:44:54,679
al vero segreto se non ci
the true secret unless...

421
00:44:54,679 --> 00:45:01,179
si accorge di tutto l'amore
one realizes all the love

422
00:45:15,660 --> 00:45:19,560
なぜ…！
What? No, how... why...?

423
00:45:19,960 --> 00:45:21,860
完璧な計画が…！
My perfect plan...

424
00:45:22,360 --> 00:45:25,660
今度こそ勝ったと思ったのに…
I thought I had you this time... I was so certain...

425
00:45:26,160 --> 00:45:28,660
なぜ貴様は 無傷なんだ？
How did you manage to get out of this unharmed?

426
00:45:29,160 --> 00:45:30,760
Mmm, music!

427
00:45:30,960 --> 00:45:31,960
なに！？
What?!

428
00:45:32,560 --> 00:45:34,360
さてと…
Well, anyways...

429
00:45:34,460 --> 00:45:37,060
オトモ達よ！ イマーレッドを完全に葬り去ろう！
Otomos, it's time! I think we gotta destroy Imma Red for good!

430
00:45:37,260 --> 00:45:40,460
チャットにアンケートが出てるでしょ？
So, there's a poll right now happening in the chat, okay?

431
00:45:40,560 --> 00:45:45,260
どの武器でアイツを消し去りたいか選んで投票してね！
And then you have to pick which weapon we're going to use in order to defeat her forever, okay?

432
00:45:45,860 --> 00:45:48,260
どれどれ… みんな投票してる？
Can I see? Let me see. Are you voting, are you voting?

433
00:45:48,560 --> 00:45:50,560
早く選んで 時間ないよ！
Pick, pick right now! We don't have a lot of time!

434
00:45:50,960 --> 00:45:54,960
投票！投票！ 早く選べ～！
Pick right now, come on! Pick already, pick already, come on!

435
00:46:05,060 --> 00:46:08,260
Oh, oh, help... hello everyone!

436
00:46:09,060 --> 00:46:15,160
Hello Otomos, nice to see... see you. What, what are you doing here?

437
00:46:20,060 --> 00:46:26,260
Oh, I'm... I'm supposed to stall... um, so that you have enough time to vote.

438
00:46:27,760 --> 00:46:34,160
Um, okay. Uh, ah... I don't like being the center of attention like this. Um... um...

439
00:46:34,760 --> 00:46:47,560
Um, did you know that... ah... Imma Red is... ah... actually the same soul just like Miss Immergreen?

440
00:46:50,560 --> 00:46:55,160
Oh, is this enough time? Oh, okay. Okay. Miss Immergreen! Miss Immergreen!

441
00:47:01,160 --> 00:47:02,860
オーケー！ いくよ！
Okay! Let's go!

442
00:47:03,460 --> 00:47:04,960
くらえ！
Take this!

443
00:47:05,260 --> 00:47:06,860
えいっ！
Hiya!

444
00:47:08,260 --> 00:47:10,460
うわっ！
Ow! Woah!

445
00:47:10,960 --> 00:47:12,560
やめろ！
Stop!

446
00:47:12,660 --> 00:47:14,260
イタタ！やめて！
Ow! Stop!

447
00:47:14,460 --> 00:47:16,760
やめろー！！
Stop it!!

448
00:47:22,860 --> 00:47:27,660
今の、私がやったの？ 念じただけで？
Holy... did I just do that with my freaking mind? Woah!

449
00:47:30,360 --> 00:47:32,260
くそぉ…！
Damn it...!

450
00:47:32,360 --> 00:47:36,060
同じ大きさに戻ってる！ よかった！
Oh, you're like the same size as me again! That's... that's great!

451
00:47:36,360 --> 00:47:38,260
何をする気だ…？
Wait, what are you... what are you doing?

452
00:47:38,760 --> 00:47:42,060
お前が私の誕生日を台無しにした分
You know what? I mean, since you ruined my entire birthday,

453
00:47:42,160 --> 00:47:44,860
盛り上げ役に働いてもらうからな！
I'm going to use you and content farm you!

454
00:47:44,960 --> 00:47:47,260
ほら！デュエットするよ！
Okay, come on! It's time for a duet!

455
00:47:47,460 --> 00:47:50,260
たっち… 来なさい！
Touch... Come on!

456
00:47:50,360 --> 00:47:51,360
本気…？
Really...?

457
00:47:51,460 --> 00:47:52,560
うん！
Yeah!

458
00:47:54,160 --> 00:47:56,260
お前… 力が強いな！
Woah, you're kind of strong!

459
00:48:11,060 --> 00:48:18,560
[Title: 魔神の笛のテーマ Music: 西浦智仁 Arrangement: Jeremy Robson]
[Title: Theme of the Last Specter Music: Tomohito Nishiura Arrangement: Jeremy Robson]

460
00:51:52,015 --> 00:51:53,015
Huh? Oh!

461
00:51:53,315 --> 00:51:57,515
Well, now you're in my mind palace instead!

462
00:51:57,915 --> 00:51:59,915
You're trapped in my head!

463
00:52:00,115 --> 00:52:04,015
Why is it always like this? I hate you, Cecilia Immergreen!

464
00:52:04,115 --> 00:52:06,915
First, you stole my chance for a body!

465
00:52:07,015 --> 00:52:09,315
Then, you trapped me for years in a jar!

466
00:52:09,415 --> 00:52:10,215
Years...?

467
00:52:10,315 --> 00:52:11,915
And now you're doing it again!

468
00:52:12,015 --> 00:52:13,315
B-But don't you have a body now?

469
00:52:13,415 --> 00:52:16,915
No! This isn't real, we're in your imagination!

470
00:52:17,315 --> 00:52:18,815
Ooh... Well...

471
00:52:19,215 --> 00:52:21,515
Sucks to suck! You're off!

472
00:52:21,615 --> 00:52:24,915
Anyways, I got a song to sing for my birthday, so...

473
00:52:25,015 --> 00:52:26,815
...bye-bye, Imma Red! And...

474
00:52:26,915 --> 00:52:28,615
...and thanks for dancing with me!

475
00:52:28,715 --> 00:52:30,715
See... see you next time! Maybe, maybe not.

476
00:52:30,815 --> 00:52:31,915
Bye!

477
00:52:32,015 --> 00:52:34,015
You're way worse than me!

478
00:52:40,215 --> 00:52:44,115
M-Miss Immergreen! Miss Immergreen, don't forget about the budget!

479
00:52:44,215 --> 00:52:46,715
Oh, oh! Miss Imma Red, nice to see you.

480
00:52:46,815 --> 00:52:49,215
Updatilia... Aren't you sick of her?

481
00:52:49,315 --> 00:52:49,915
Huh?

482
00:52:50,015 --> 00:52:54,015
She was just using us as content for entertainment, and then she forgets about us!

483
00:52:54,115 --> 00:52:57,315
I mean, I see how it might seem that way to you, but...

484
00:52:57,415 --> 00:53:00,715
...why don't you just do something else unrelated to her? Get away, you know?

485
00:53:00,815 --> 00:53:04,215
Stop fighting her and just do your own thing. Be your own person!

486
00:53:05,215 --> 00:53:07,215
You... you both are... incredibly weak after all.

487
00:53:07,315 --> 00:53:11,715
The fights aren't very impressive to the audience, you know?

488
00:53:12,115 --> 00:53:14,115
I mean... maybe.

489
00:53:14,215 --> 00:53:20,115
Well, uh... I gotta go do my job, but, um... Here's my address, and you can visit me at any time, okay? I'll be there.

490
00:53:20,215 --> 00:53:23,615
Ah! Miss Immergreen! Miss Immergreen, you forgot your merch segment! Miss Immergreen!

491
00:53:34,615 --> 00:53:37,615
I hate it here.

492
00:53:44,715 --> 00:53:47,215
Ah, hello everyone! It's me, Updatilia!

493
00:53:47,315 --> 00:53:53,015
And this is the Evergreen Reprise birthday merch!

494
00:53:53,215 --> 00:53:55,015
Yay! Yeah!

495
00:53:55,115 --> 00:53:59,915
First off, we have the Rubbery Rubber Mat, which is a beautiful illustration drawn by Quasarcake...

496
00:54:00,015 --> 00:54:04,115
...which depicts both Miss Immergreen and Miss Imma Red together!

497
00:54:04,215 --> 00:54:10,815
It's really big, and it's great for your office! I have one here right in front of me, so please check it out!

498
00:54:10,915 --> 00:54:18,115
Next item we have is the 'Get as Many as Possible' Sticker Sheet!

499
00:54:18,215 --> 00:54:23,615
So you can get as many as possible of these, and it's a sticker sheet with six stickers on there.

500
00:54:23,715 --> 00:54:29,715
Three of them were drawn by the great artist isarobn, and the other three were drawn by Miss Immergreen herself!

501
00:54:29,815 --> 00:54:34,715
There's a bunch of different illustrations. There's Miss Imma Red on there...

502
00:54:34,815 --> 00:54:40,815
...and also... Oh! Imma Gold Bot! Haven't seen her in a while, I wonder what she's been up to.

503
00:54:40,915 --> 00:54:48,415
And... Oh! Miss Ouro Kronii is on here! What is... What is she doing on here?

504
00:54:48,515 --> 00:54:53,015
Oh, okay! Well... So you can get this 'Get as Many as Possible' Sticker Sheet set!

505
00:54:53,115 --> 00:55:01,715
And then, next, we have one plushie and another plushie! Two separate plushies: Immergreen Plushie Keychain and Immerred Plushie Keychain!

506
00:55:02,356 --> 00:55:04,956
揃えるもよし！ 別々にするもよし！
You can get them together! You can get them separately!

507
00:55:05,236 --> 00:55:08,916
どちらかだけ、大量に買うのも やや意地悪ですが アリでしょう！
Buying a lot of just one is a bit mean, but it's an option!

508
00:55:09,116 --> 00:55:12,476
2つ並べて 仲良くさせてみる試みも いいと思います！
I think it's also worth trying to place them side by side and make them get along!

509
00:55:12,756 --> 00:55:16,516
私やってみましたが… 和解するかどうかは、不明です
I tried it too, but whether they'll reconcile is unknown...

510
00:55:17,036 --> 00:55:22,756
以上が 今回の 誕生日記念グッズになります！
Those are the birthday merch items for this time!

511
00:55:23,076 --> 00:55:27,196
ボイスパックもありますので そちらも 要チェックです！
We also have a voice pack, so be sure to check that out as well!

512
00:55:27,436 --> 00:55:29,116
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

513
00:55:29,396 --> 00:55:33,076
もし 今回の グッズの 売上が良ければ…
If the sales for this merch do well...

514
00:55:33,276 --> 00:55:36,756
次回の予算が増えるかも… ですよねイマーグリーン様？
Maybe next time's budget will increase... right, Miss Immergreen?

515
00:55:36,996 --> 00:55:40,036
そんなことないから 勝手なこと言うな！
That's not true, so don't say whatever you want!

516
00:55:40,236 --> 00:55:43,756
なるほど…とのことです！
I see... so she says!

517
00:55:44,036 --> 00:55:46,996
誕生日記念グッズ 要チェックですよ！
Be sure to check out the birthday merch!

518
00:55:47,196 --> 00:55:50,036
この後もう一曲ありますので チャンネルはそのままで！
There's one more song after this, so stay tuned!

519
00:55:50,236 --> 00:55:54,076
イマーグリーン様の 確定申告がありますので… 失礼します
I have Miss Immergreen's tax return to do, so excuse me...

520
00:56:12,736 --> 00:56:27,236
[Title: Gales of Song (English Version)]

521
00:57:34,636 --> 00:57:43,736
La, la, la...

522
00:57:45,236 --> 00:57:49,736
Gales of song

523
00:57:50,436 --> 00:57:55,836
Guide me through the storm

524
00:58:06,236 --> 00:58:11,736
On the wings of a small, simple melody

525
00:58:12,236 --> 00:58:17,736
Words take flight and soar, they carry me

526
00:58:18,436 --> 00:58:20,636
A world we'll see

527
00:58:21,036 --> 00:58:25,436
Looking for a farewell, I pull the threads

528
00:58:26,036 --> 00:58:29,736
A life without you I cannot accept

529
00:58:30,036 --> 00:58:33,036
I can't tell that lie

530
00:58:33,236 --> 00:58:36,036
I can't let go

531
00:58:36,236 --> 00:58:39,836
But now that you're gone, I have to move on

532
00:58:40,036 --> 00:58:43,436
Seems like everyone just smiles staring at the sun

533
00:58:43,736 --> 00:58:46,036
But what about me?

534
00:58:46,236 --> 00:58:52,036
Tell me how I will know where I should go?

535
00:58:52,236 --> 00:58:57,436
Oh, gales, you sing and guide me!

536
00:58:57,736 --> 00:58:59,836
I walk alone

537
00:59:00,036 --> 00:59:03,036
There's more to life I have to know

538
00:59:03,236 --> 00:59:09,736
It's just me, lost so far away from home, alone

539
00:59:10,236 --> 00:59:12,736
Shut myself in

540
00:59:13,036 --> 00:59:16,436
Still the winds howl, they call

541
00:59:16,636 --> 00:59:19,436
And their voices lead me

542
00:59:19,636 --> 00:59:24,036
Gales of song, guide me through the storm

543
00:59:24,236 --> 00:59:30,736
Let the melody lift me high, I'll be me

544
00:59:32,236 --> 00:59:35,436
Gales of song

545
00:59:35,736 --> 00:59:39,036
Please stay by my side

546
00:59:39,236 --> 00:59:42,736
Winds of love

547
00:59:43,036 --> 00:59:48,236
Breathe into my life

548
00:59:54,436 --> 01:00:02,836
初めての3D生誕ライブ見てくれてありがとう！
Thank you for watching my very first 3D birthday live!

549
01:00:03,036 --> 01:00:04,236
本当にありがとう！
Thank you so much!

550
01:00:04,257 --> 01:00:07,677
...lots. Um, yeah, thank you very much to all my wonderful guests that were here today!

551
01:00:07,857 --> 01:00:09,707
Thanks for Imma Red, I guess?

552
01:00:09,907 --> 01:00:11,657
And also for Otomos,

553
01:00:11,957 --> 01:00:17,907
and this... this deer. I don't know what it's doing here actually, now that I think about it...

554
01:00:18,257 --> 01:00:20,057
Well, anyway, thank you very much!

555
01:00:20,257 --> 01:00:23,657
Um, please stay tuned, because there's going to be a membership stream...

556
01:00:24,057 --> 01:00:27,507
...with an extra song and a little bit of something special right after this.

557
01:00:27,757 --> 01:00:30,007
And if you're interested, please check out the merch as well!

558
01:00:30,257 --> 01:00:34,257
Thank you very much! Thank you also staff! Arigatou gozaimasu, staff-san!
Thank you very much! Thank you also staff! Thank you very much, staff!

559
01:00:34,457 --> 01:00:38,257
And everyone who worked on this beautiful, beautiful birthday! I had a lot of fun!

560
01:00:38,457 --> 01:00:42,057
And even if Imma Red ruined some of it, I think overall was still good.

561
01:00:42,257 --> 01:00:44,657
And thank you very much Otomos. I'm gonna give you a hug now!

562
01:00:44,957 --> 01:00:47,957
Hug! Hug, hug, hug, hug, hug... Okay!

563
01:00:48,157 --> 01:00:49,557
Okay, bye!

564
01:00:51,557 --> 01:00:53,257
Where's Kronii?

565
01:01:17,957 --> 01:01:19,457
Lie...
No way...

566
01:01:29,757 --> 01:01:30,757
Ah...

567
01:01:31,057 --> 01:01:32,657
Help...

568
01:01:33,057 --> 01:01:36,657
Help... Save me...

569
01:01:40,057 --> 01:01:42,057
Anyone?
Is anyone there?

